Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.12,0:00:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, the magic energy flow is normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, forgive me if this\Nis none of my business,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you wish to speak with\NLammis, I'd happily relay your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.68,0:00:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.64,0:00:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have much deeper\Nconversations with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammis if I were to rely on Kikuyu's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, M-O. Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.28,0:00:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me if such\Na request is presumptuous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.58,0:00:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.98,0:00:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm touched, but the first time I really\Ntalk to Lamas, it'll be on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There we go, and success!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, let's proceed through in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.38,0:00:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can start with Kikuyu's group.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.30,0:00:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.21,0:00:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much, Hulani.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And lastly, us. Yeah. I'll\Nactivate it. Go ahead. Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.90,0:00:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:01:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's with this red light?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.36,0:01:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.84,0:01:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found nothing out of\Nthe ordinary with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't want to be\Naway from Botto again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.38,0:01:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want us to be\Napart anymore either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.70,0:01:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we could at least\Nall stay in one group.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.26,0:01:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Activate barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.02,0:01:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please just let it send\Nus all to the same place.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.10,0:01:22.97,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.38,0:01:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside I'm just a big metal box\Nbut inside I've still got a human soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.02,0:01:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of\Nwonders I travel to and
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.36,0:01:36.24,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.38,0:01:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fro on the back of my\Nsuper strong partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.18,0:01:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Llamas? The name's Boxo. Hello\Nthere. That means "yes" by the way.
